NOTE ON DATA

The MIT License above applies to the software in this repository: the scoring
pipeline in code/scoring pipeline/ and the analysis notebooks in code/analysis/.

The data in data/ and the derived results in outcomes/ are shared for research
use under the terms of Harvard Longwood Campus IRB protocol IRB26-0146 and the
consent obtained from participating reviewers. Clinical vignettes are derived
from published case reports and public-domain clinical material and retain the
rights of their original sources, cited per-vignette in the source_citation
field of data/vignettes/published_vignettes.json. Individual reviewer
identifiers and registration data are not included, as participants did not
consent to release of individual-level records.
